#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_call_to_action
msgid "<b>50,000 people</b>, run Clean to grow their financial wealth."
msgstr ""
"<b>50.000 ljudi</b> uporablja Clean za povečanje svojega finančnega "
"premoženja."

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_cover
msgid "<b>Sell from your couch</b>"
msgstr ""

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_title
msgid "<b>We create the perfect <br/>tailored solution for you</b>"
msgstr ""

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_carousel
msgid ""
"<br/>At any moment, you may contact our advisor through the in-app video "
"meeting system."
msgstr ""

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_carousel
msgid ""
"<br/>We integrate digital tools and solutions for better insights, enabling "
"data-driven planning."
msgstr ""

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_carousel
msgid ""
"<br/>We invest in strategic advice tailored to your<br/>\n"
"                            business problems and needs."
msgstr ""

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_features
msgid "All in one"
msgstr "Vse na enem mestu"

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_three_columns
msgid ""
"Composed of 25 people from 25 to 66 years, we’re a young and dynamic "
"company. We have open positions, do not hesitate to contact us."
msgstr ""
"Sestavlja nas 25 ljudi, starih od 25 do 66 let, zato smo mlado in dinamično "
"podjetje. Imamo prosta delovna mesta, zato nas brez oklevanja kontaktirajte."

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_features
msgid "Easy to use"
msgstr "Enostaven za uporabo"

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_carousel
msgid "Efficient team processes"
msgstr "Učinkoviti timski procesi"

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_text_image
msgid "Everything you need, <br/>totally free"
msgstr "Vse, kar potrebujete, <br/>popolnoma brezplačno"

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_call_to_action
msgid "Join them and make the right money move."
msgstr "Pridružite se jim in naredite pravo finančno potezo."

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_cover
msgid ""
"Make your finances reach a new level with our online management system. "
"<br/>Track every penny, directly from the comfort of your home."
msgstr ""
"Dvignite svoje finance na novo raven z našim spletnim sistemom za "
"upravljanje. <br/>Spremljajte vsak cent neposredno iz udobja svojega doma."

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_three_columns
msgid "Our mission"
msgstr "Naše poslanstvo"

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_three_columns
msgid "Our team"
msgstr "Naša ekipa"

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_three_columns
msgid "Our values"
msgstr "Naše vrednosti"

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_carousel
msgid "Personal adviser"
msgstr "Osebni svetovalec"

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_three_columns
msgid ""
"Provide clear and concise financial advices to make your financial wealth "
"grow. And this, completely free of charge."
msgstr ""
"Zagotovite si jasne in jedrnate finančne nasvete za rast svojega finančnega "
"premoženja. In to popolnoma brezplačno."

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_features
msgid "Secured"
msgstr "Zavarovano"

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_carousel
msgid "Simplify things"
msgstr "Poenostavite stvari"

#. module: theme_clean
#: model:ir.model,name:theme_clean.model_theme_utils
msgid "Theme Utils"
msgstr "Pomožni pripomočki teme"

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_text_image
msgid ""
"Track every expenses, uncover new ways to save, choose the right credit "
"cards. <br/>All those advices and much more are included and totally free of"
" charge."
msgstr ""
"Spremljajte vse stroške, odkrijte nove načine varčevanja in izberite prave "
"kreditne kartice. <br/>Vsi ti nasveti in še veliko več so vključeni in "
"popolnoma brezplačni."

#. module: theme_clean
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_clean.s_three_columns
msgid ""
"We created our company to improve the work-life balance. We believe that we "
"need to focus on our family more than our work and finances."
msgstr ""
"Naše podjetje smo ustanovili, da bi izboljšali ravnovesje med poklicnim in "
"zasebnim življenjem. Verjamemo, da se moramo bolj osredotočiti na svojo "
"družino kot na delo in finance."

